{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Up to the gate.</b> So was the custom and the Torah for a court." "<b>Such a one, Almoni.</b> Some say it is from 'מופלא', and 'אלמוני' from 'אלם', that he has no known name among those who speak."], :book :ruth, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ruth -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ruth"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:31.682023666Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}